      "body": "Well, this got sidetracked, but we are past 4.10 on rolling now.\n\nhttps://github.com/ros2/ros2/blob/1f89e94bd2b064c9507d8d42f3ca1ef6f057fe37/pixi.toml#L111",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Well, this got sidetracked, but we are past 4.10 on rolling now.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ros2/ros2/blob/1f89e94bd2b064c9507d8d42f3ca1ef6f057fe37/pixi.toml#L111\">ros2/pixi.toml</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 111\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/ros2/ros2/commit/1f89e94bd2b064c9507d8d42f3ca1ef6f057fe37\">1f89e94</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L111\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"111\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC111\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-smi\">opencv</span> = <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>==4.13.0<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>  <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> TODO: Ubuntu has 4.10.0, but conda-forge has no Python 3.14 build before 4.13.0</span> </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>",
      "bodyVersion": "dbde8535271450bd86bf2fac73cf94ab3ddf284ecd19b54cb3f4b22d5e6cbef7",
